Usage:

# Getting content

`./download.sh $URL $URL $URL`

# Local backup

Full duplicate current directory to neighboring directory with timestamped name.

`./backup`

# Converting content:

`./list.sh` - generate list of content to transcode

`./encode_audio.sh` - output audio-only encodes to audio_output

`./encode_video.sh` - output audio-only encodes to video_output

`./sync.sh` - copy encoded audio/video over to torrent-compose samba share directory
